#: kplayer.cpp:496
msgid ""
"Main toolbar contains buttons for commonly used operations. Left clicking an "
"icon will activate the corresponding action. Some of the buttons will pop up "
"slider controls when clicked. The sliders let you change various player "
"controls: sound volume, video contrast, brightness, hue and saturation. The "
"video controls will only be available for video files."
msgstr ""
"De Hööft-Warktüüchbalken bargt Knööp för faken bruukt Akschonen. Mit en "
"Linksklick op en Lüttbild warrt de tohören Akschoon utföhrt. En Reeg vun "
"disse Knööp maakt bi't Anklicken en Opdukfinster mit Stüerschuvers op. Mit "
"disse Schuvers laat sik verscheden Funkschonen stüern: Luutstärk, Kontrast, "
"Helligkeit, Klöörtoon un Sattheit. De Bildinstellen sünd bloots för "
"Videodateien verföögbor."

#: kplayer.cpp:497
msgid ""
"Playlist toolbar shows the multimedia title currently loaded or being "
"played, offers commands to go to the next or previous items on the playlist, "
"and also lets you see the entire playlist that consists of items that are "
"currently being played or have been played recently. If you select a "
"different item from the list, KPlayer will load and start playing it. The "
"toolbar also contains options to loop and shuffle the playlist."
msgstr ""
"De Afspeellist-Warktüüchbalken wiest de aktuell laadt oder afspeelt Stücken, "
"bargt Befehlen för't Afspelen vun't nakamen oder verleden Stück. Een kann "
"aver ok de hele Afspeellist mit de tolest afspeelt Stücken ankieken. Wenn en "
"anner Stück ut de List utsöcht warrt, laadt KPlayer dat un speelt dat af. De "
"Warktüüchbalken bargt ok anner Optschonen a.B. dat Wedderhalen vun Stücken "
"un Afspelen dwars de Afspeellist."

#: kplayer.cpp:498
msgid ""
"Progress and seeking toolbar is shown when the time length of a media file "
"is known. It displays the playback progress and also allows seeking, that "
"is, moving the playback point back and forth within the file. To seek to a "
"specific position, drag the slider thumb to that position with the left "
"mouse button, or simply click at that position with the middle mouse button. "
"To move forward or backward in steps, left click the slider to the left or "
"right of the thumb, or click the Forward and Backward buttons."
msgstr ""
"De Vörankamen- un Stüerbalken warrt wiest, wenn de Längde vun en Stück "
"begäng is. He wiest dat Vörankamen bi't Afspelen, wat Du dor ok mit stüern "
"kannst. Du kannst den Schuver mit den linken Muusknoop na de niege Steed "
"trecken oder dor mit den Middelmuusknoop op klicken, dat Afspelen geiht denn "
"bi de niege Steed wieder. Klickst Du rechter- oder linkerhand vun den "
"Schuver mit den linken Muusknoop oder bruukst Du den Vörut- oder Torüch-"
"Knoop, jumpt de Schuver en na de angeven Richt."

#: kplayer.cpp:499
msgid ""
"Volume toolbar has a volume slider that shows the current sound volume and "
"allows you to change it. This is the same slider you get from the volume pop-"
"up slider button on the main toolbar, but it will not disappear when you "
"click elsewhere. You can show or hide the toolbar using the Show Volume "
"Toolbar option on the Settings menu. Clicking the Volume button on this "
"toolbar will also hide it. In addition the toolbar has a Mute button that "
"turns the sound off and back on."
msgstr ""
"Op den Luutstärk-Balken gifft dat en Schuver, mit den Du de Luutstärk vun de "
"Kläng annern kannst. Dat is de sülve Schuver as de, den Du över den "
"Luutstärk-Schuverknoop op den Hööftbalken opropen kannst, man he geiht nich "
"wedder weg, wenn Du annerwarts klickst. Du kannst den Balken mit den "
"Menüpunkt \"Luutstärkbalken wiesen\" binnen dat Instellen-Menü wiesen oder "
"versteken; de Luutstärk-Knoop op dissen Balken verstickt em ok. Bito gifft "
"dat op den Balken en \"Still\"-Knoop, mit den Du de Kläng an- un utmaken "
"kannst."

#: kplayer.cpp:500
msgid ""
"Contrast toolbar has a contrast slider that shows the current video contrast "
"and allows you to change it. This is the same slider you get from the "
"contrast pop-up slider button on the main toolbar, but it will not disappear "
"when you click elsewhere. You can show or hide the toolbar using the Show "
"Contrast Toolbar option on the Settings menu. Clicking the Contrast button "
"on this toolbar will also hide it."
msgstr ""
"Op den Kontrastbalken gifft dat en Schuver, mit den Du den aktuellen Video-"
"Kontrast topassen kannst. Dat is de sülve Schuver as de, den Du över den "
"Kontrast-Schuverknoop op den Hööftbalken opropen kannst, man he geiht nich "
"wedder weg, wenn Du annerwarts klickst. Du kannst den Balken mit den "
"Menüpunkt \"Kontrastbalken wiesen\" binnen dat Instellen-Menü wiesen oder "
"versteken; de Kontrast-Knoop op dissen Balken verstickt em ok."

#: kplayer.cpp:501
msgid ""
"Brightness toolbar has a brightness slider that shows the current video "
"brightness and allows you to change it. This is the same slider you get from "
"the brightness pop-up slider button on the main toolbar, but it will not "
"disappear when you click elsewhere. You can show or hide the toolbar using "
"the Show Brightness Toolbar option on the Settings menu. Clicking the "
"Brightness button on this toolbar will also hide it."
msgstr ""
"Op den Helligkeitbalken gifft dat en Schuver, mit den Du de aktuelle Video-"
"Helligkeit topassen kannst. Dat is de sülve Schuver as de, den Du över den "
"Helligkeit-Schuverknoop op den Hööftbalken opropen kannst, man he geiht nich "
"wedder weg, wenn Du annerwarts klickst. Du kannst den Balken mit den "
"Menüpunkt \"Helligkeitbalken wiesen\" binnen dat Instellen-Menü wiesen oder "
"versteken; de Helligkeit-Knoop op dissen Balken verstickt em ok."

#: kplayer.cpp:502
msgid ""
"Hue toolbar has a hue slider that shows the current video hue and allows you "
"to change it. This is the same slider you get from the hue pop-up slider "
"button on the main toolbar, but it will not disappear when you click "
"elsewhere. You can show or hide the toolbar using the Show Hue Toolbar "
"option on the Settings menu. Clicking the Hue button on this toolbar will "
"also hide it."
msgstr ""
"Op den Klöörtoonbalken gifft dat en Schuver, mit den Du den aktuellen Video-"
"Klöörtoon topassen kannst. Dat is de sülve Schuver as de, den Du över den "
"Klöörtoon-Schuverknoop op den Hööftbalken opropen kannst, man he geiht nich "
"wedder weg, wenn Du annerwarts klickst. Du kannst den Balken mit den "
"Menüpunkt \"Klöörtoonbalken wiesen\" binnen dat Instellen-Menü wiesen oder "
"versteken; de Klöörtoon-Knoop op dissen Balken verstickt em ok."

#: kplayer.cpp:503
msgid ""
"Saturation toolbar has a saturation slider that shows the current video "
"saturation and allows you to change it. This is the same slider you get from "
"the saturation pop-up slider button on the main toolbar, but it will not "
"disappear when you click elsewhere. You can show or hide the toolbar using "
"the Show Saturation Toolbar option on the Settings menu. Clicking the "
"Saturation button on this toolbar will also hide it."
msgstr ""
"Op den Sattheitbalken gifft dat en Schuver, mit den Du de aktuelle Video-"
"Sattheit topassen kannst. Dat is de sülve Schuver as de, den Du över den "
"Sattheit-Schuverknoop op den Hööftbalken opropen kannst, man he geiht nich "
"wedder weg, wenn Du annerwarts klickst. Du kannst den Balken mit den "
"Menüpunkt \"Sattheitbalken wiesen\" binnen dat Instellen-Menü wiesen oder "
"versteken; de Sattheit-Knoop op dissen Balken verstickt em ok."

#: kplayer.cpp:608
msgid ""
"Menu bar contains names of drop-down menus. Left click a name to alternately "
"show and hide that menu, or use Alt + the underlined letter in the name as a "
"hot key, for example Alt+F to show the File menu."
msgstr ""
"De Menübalken bargt de Naams vun Opmaak-Menüs. En Linksklick op en Naam "
"maakt dat Menü op oder to. Du kannst de Menüs ok mit Alt+ den ünnerstreken "
"Bookstaven op- un tomaken, so as Alt+D för't Menü \"Datei\"."

#: kplayer.cpp:609
msgid "Status bar shows general information about the player status and progress."
msgstr ""
"De Statusbalken wiest allgemeen Informatschonen dor över, wat de Afspeler so "
"deit un drievt."

#: kplayer.cpp:649
msgid "Quits KPlayer"
msgstr "Maakt KPlayer ut"

#: kplayer.cpp:650
msgid ""
"Quit command saves the playlist and all settings, stops playing and closes "
"KPlayer."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Utmaken\" sekert de Afspeellist un all Instellen, höllt dat "
"Afspelen an un maakt KPlayer to."

#: kplayer.cpp:653 kplayer.cpp:1993
msgid "Shows/hides the menu bar"
msgstr "Menübalken wiesen/versteken"

#: kplayer.cpp:654
msgid "Show Menubar command shows or hides the menu bar."
msgstr "De Befehl \"Menübalken wiesen\" wiest oder verstickt den Menübalken."

#: kplayer.cpp:657 kplayer.cpp:2000
msgid "Shows/hides the status bar"
msgstr "Statusbalken wiesen/versteken"

#: kplayer.cpp:658
msgid "Show Statusbar command shows or hides the status bar."
msgstr "De Befehl \"Statusbalken wiesen\" wiest oder verstickt den Statusbalken."

#: kplayer.cpp:663
msgid "&Show Playlist"
msgstr "Afspeellist wie&sen"

#: kplayer.cpp:665
msgid "Shows/hides the playlist"
msgstr "Afspeellist wiesen/versteken"

#: kplayer.cpp:666
msgid "Show Playlist command shows or hides the playlist toolbar."
msgstr "De Befehl \"Afspeellist wiesen\" wiest oder verstickt de Afspeellist."

#: kplayer.cpp:671
msgid "Sho&w Library"
msgstr "Bibliotheek &wiesen"

#: kplayer.cpp:673
msgid "Shows/hides the multimedia library"
msgstr "Multimedia-Bibliotheek wiesen/versteken"

#: kplayer.cpp:674
msgid "Show Library command shows or hides the multimedia library."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Bibliotheek wiesen\" wiest oder verstickt de Multimedia-"
"Bibliotheek."

#: kplayer.cpp:679
msgid "Show Message &Log"
msgstr "Narichten-&Logbook wiesen"

#: kplayer.cpp:681
msgid "Shows/hides the message log"
msgstr "Narichten-Logbook wiesen/versteken"

#: kplayer.cpp:682
msgid "Show Message Log command shows or hides the message log."
msgstr "De Befehl \"Logbook wiesen\" wiest oder verstickt dat Narichten-Logbook."

#: kplayer.cpp:687
msgid "Show Main &Toolbar"
msgstr "Hööf&tbalken wiesen"

#: kplayer.cpp:688
msgid "Shows/hides the main toolbar"
msgstr "Hööftbalken wiesen/versteken"

#: kplayer.cpp:689
msgid "Show Main Toolbar command shows or hides the main toolbar."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Hööftbalken wiesen\" wiest oder verstickt den Hööft-"
"Warktüüchbalken."

#: kplayer.cpp:694
msgid "Show &Progress Toolbar"
msgstr "&Vörankamenbalken wiesen"

#: kplayer.cpp:695
msgid "Shows/hides the progress toolbar"
msgstr "Vörankamenbalken wiesen/versteken"

#: kplayer.cpp:696
msgid ""
"Show Progress Toolbar command shows or hides the progress toolbar. This "
"command is available when the time length of the current file is known."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Vörankamenbalken wiesen\" wiest oder verstickt den Vörankamen-"
"Warktüüchbalken. Disse Befehl is verföögbor, wenn de Speeltiet vun de "
"aktuelle Datei künnig is."

#: kplayer.cpp:701
msgid "Show &Volume Toolbar"
msgstr "&Luutstärkbalken wiesen"

#: kplayer.cpp:703
msgid "Shows/hides the volume toolbar"
msgstr "Luutstärkbalken wiesen/versteken"

#: kplayer.cpp:704
msgid "Show Volume Toolbar command shows or hides the volume toolbar."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Luutstärkbalken wiesen\" wiest oder verstickt den Luutstärk-"
"Warktüüchbalken."

#: kplayer.cpp:709
msgid "Show C&ontrast Toolbar"
msgstr "K&ontrastbalken wiesen"

#: kplayer.cpp:711
msgid "Shows/hides the contrast toolbar"
msgstr "Kontrastbalken wiesen/versteken"

#: kplayer.cpp:712
msgid ""
"Show Contrast Toolbar command shows or hides the contrast toolbar. This "
"command is available for video files."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Kontrastbalken wiesen\" wiest oder verstickt den Kontrast-"
"Warktüüchbalken."

#: kplayer.cpp:717
msgid "Show &Brightness Toolbar"
msgstr "Helligkeit&balken wiesen"

#: kplayer.cpp:719
msgid "Shows/hides the brightness toolbar"
msgstr "Helligkeitbalken wiesen/versteken"

#: kplayer.cpp:720
msgid ""
"Show Brightness Toolbar command shows or hides the brightness toolbar. This "
"command is available for video files."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Helligkeitbalken wiesen\" wiest oder verstickt den Helligkeit-"
"Warktüüchbalken."

#: kplayer.cpp:725
msgid "Show H&ue Toolbar"
msgstr "&Klöörtoonbalken wiesen"

#: kplayer.cpp:727
msgid "Shows/hides the hue toolbar"
msgstr "Klöörtoonbalken wiesen/versteken"

#: kplayer.cpp:728
msgid ""
"Show Hue Toolbar command shows or hides the hue toolbar. This command is "
"available for video files."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Klöörtoonbalken wiesen\" wiest oder verstickt den Klöörtoon-"
"Warktüüchbalken."

#: kplayer.cpp:733
msgid "Show &Saturation Toolbar"
msgstr "&Sattheitbalken wiesen"

#: kplayer.cpp:735
msgid "Shows/hides the saturation toolbar"
msgstr "Sattheitbalken wiesen/versteken"

#: kplayer.cpp:736
msgid ""
"Show Saturation Toolbar command shows or hides the saturation toolbar. This "
"command is available for video files."
msgstr ""
"De Befehl \"Sattheitbalken wiesen\" wiest oder verstickt den Sattheit-"
"Warktüüchbalken. Disse Befehl is bi Videodateien verföögbor."

#: kplayer.cpp:739
msgid "Opens the KPlayer key bindings dialog"
msgstr "KPlayer sien Tasttowiesen-Dialoog opmaken"

#: kplayer.cpp:740
msgid ""
"Configure Shortcuts command opens a dialog that lets you see and change "
"KPlayer's shortcut key bindings, or associations between actions and the "
"corresponding keys or combinations of keys that activate them. If you change "
"the bindings, make sure not to duplicate an existing shortcut and also not "
"to use the Shift key for your new shortcuts, because the Shift key has a "
"special function in KPlayer."
msgstr "De Befehl \"Tastkombinatschonen instellen\" maakt en Dialoog op, binnen den Du KPlayer sien Tastkombinatschonen bekieken un topassen kannst. De Tastkombinatschonen sünd Towiesen vun Tasten oder Kombinatschonen vun Tasten to Akschonen, Du kannst dor de Akschonen mit opropen. Wenn Du Towiesen ännerst, acht dor bitte op un bruuk keen Kombinatschoon dubbelt. De Ümschalttast muttst Du nich bruken, se hett in KPlayer en besünner Funkschoon."

#: kplayer.cpp:743
msgid "Opens the KPlayer toolbar configuration dialog"
msgstr "Kplayer sien Warktüüchbalken-Instellendialoog opmaken"

#: kplayer.cpp:744
msgid ""
"Configure Toolbars command opens a dialog that lets you see and change "
"KPlayer's toolbars and controls assigned to them."
msgstr "De Befehl \"Warktüüchbalkens instellen\" maakt en Dialoog op, binnen den Du KPlayer sien Warktüüchbalkens un de Knööp dor op bekieken un topassen kannst."

#: kplayer.cpp:747
msgid "Opens the KPlayer configuration dialog"
msgstr "KPlayer sien Instellendialoog opmaken"

#: kplayer.cpp:748
msgid ""
"Configure KPlayer command opens a dialog that lets you configure the "
"program, modifying various aspects of its functionality, user interface and "
"interaction with MPlayer. For more information see the Configuration dialog "
"chapter and the Advanced configuration micro-HOWTO in the user manual."
msgstr "De Befehl \"KPlayer instellen\" maakt en Dialoog op, binnen den Du dat Programm sien Instellen topassen kannst, so as en Reeg Funkschonen, de Böversiet un dat Tosamenspeel mit MPlayer. Kiek Di man dat Kapitel \"Instellen-Dialoog\" un de \"Kortanleden verwiedert Instellen\" binnen dat Bruker-Handbook an, wenn Du mehr weten wullt."

#: kplayer.cpp:810 kplayer.cpp:821 kplayer.cpp:1285 kplayer.cpp:1351
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "Fardig"

#: kplayer.cpp:811 kplayer.cpp:823 kplayer.cpp:1521
msgid "Idle"
msgstr "Keen Aktiviteet"

#: kplayer.cpp:833
msgid "Status area of the status bar tells you if there have been playback errors."
msgstr "Dat Statusrebeet vun den Statusbalken wiest Afspeelfehlers."

#: kplayer.cpp:836
msgid "State area of the status bar displays the current player state."
msgstr "Dat Tostandrebeet vun den Statusbalken wiest den Tostand vun den Afspeler."

#: kplayer.cpp:838
msgid ""
"Progress area of the status bar shows playback progress and the total length "
"if known."
msgstr "Dat Vörankamen-Rebeet vun den Statusbalken wiest dat Vörankamen bi't Afspelen un de Heellängde, wenn de begäng is."

#: kplayer.cpp:1521
msgid "Running"
msgstr "Löppt"

#: kplayer.cpp:1521
msgid "Playing"
msgstr "Afspelen"

#: kplayer.cpp:1521
msgid "Paused"
msgstr "Anhollen"

#: kplayer.cpp:1563
#, kde-format
msgid "Cache fill: %1%"
msgstr "Twischenspiekerbruuk: %1%"

#: kplayer.cpp:1564
#, kde-format
msgid "Generating index: %1%"
msgstr "Index warrt opstellt: %1"

#: kplayer.cpp:1565
#, kde-format
msgid "Transferring file: %1%"
msgstr "Datei warrt överdragen: %1%"

#: kplayer.cpp:1595
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Fehler"

#: kplayeractionlist.cpp:324 kplayerengine.cpp:948 kplayerengine.cpp:951
#: kplayerengine.cpp:954 kplayerproperties.cpp:3898
#, kde-format
msgid "Track %1"
msgstr "Stück %1"

#: kplayeractionlist.cpp:351
msgid "Norwegian"
msgstr "Norweegsch"

#: kplayeractionlist.cpp:439
msgid "&None"
msgstr "&Keen"

#: kplayeractionlist.cpp:440
msgid "Turns off subtitle display"
msgstr "Maakt dat Wiesen vun Ünnertiteln ut"

#: kplayeractionlist.cpp:441
msgid "Subtitles None command turns off subtitle display."
msgstr "De Ünertitelbefehl \"Keen\" maakt de Ünnertiteln ut."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:490
msgid "&Properties..."
msgstr "&Egenschappen..."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:493
msgid "Opens the File Properties dialog"
msgstr "Maakt den Dateiegenschappen-Dialoog op"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:494
msgid ""
"Properties command opens the File Properties dialog that lets you choose "
"many options specific to the currently loaded file. See the File properties "
"micro-HOWTO for details."
msgstr "De Befehl \"Egenschappen\" maakt den Dialoog \"Datei-Egenschappen\" op. Dor binnen kannst Du en Reeg Optschonen för de opstunns laadte Datei fastleggen. Kiek binnen de \"Kortanleden Dateiegenschappen\", wenn Du mehr weten wullt."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:499 kplayernodeview.cpp:3286
msgid "&Play"
msgstr "&Afspelen"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:502
msgid "Plays the currently loaded file"
msgstr "Speelt de aktuell laadt Datei af"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:503
msgid ""
"Play command starts playback of the current file. If the player has been "
"paused, this command resumes playback. This command is available when a file "
"is loaded."
msgstr "De Befehl \"Afspelen\" start dat Afspelen vun de aktuelle Datei. Wöör de Afspeler anhollen, geiht dat Afspelen wieder. De Befehl is verföögbor, wenn dor opstunns en Datei laadt is."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:508
msgid "Paus&e"
msgstr "&Paus"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:511
msgid "Pauses the player"
msgstr "Afspelen ünnerbreken"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:512
msgid ""
"Pause command pauses or resumes playback of the current file. This command "
"is available when the player is not idle."
msgstr "De Befehl \"Paus\" höllt dat Afspelen an oder maakt dor mit wieder. Disse Befehl is verföögbor, wenn de Afspeler wat speelt."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:517
msgid "&Stop"
msgstr "&Ophollen"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:520
msgid "Stops the player"
msgstr "Afspelen ophollen"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:521
msgid ""
"Stop command stops playback of the current file. This command is available "
"when the player is not idle."
msgstr "De Befehl \"Ophollen\" höört mit dat Afspelen vun de aktuelle Datei op. Disse Befehl is verföögbor, wenn de Afspeler wat speelt."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:526 kplayernodeview.cpp:3403
msgid "&Forward"
msgstr "&Vörut"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:528
msgid "Moves playback forward"
msgstr "Jumpt bi't Afspelen vörut"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:529
msgid ""
"Forward command moves playback forward by one percent of the time length of "
"the current file. This command is available when playing a file."
msgstr "De Befehl \"Vörut\" jumpt bi't Afspelen en Perzent vun dat Stück sien Längde vörut. Disse Befehl is verföögbor, wenn en Datei afspeelt warrt."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:534
msgid "F&ast Forward"
msgstr "G&au vörut"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:537
msgid "Moves playback forward fast"
msgstr "Jumpt bi't Afspelen en groot Stoot vörut"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:538
msgid ""
"Fast Forward command moves playback forward by ten percent of the time "
"length of the current file. This command is available when playing a file."
msgstr "De Befehl \"Gau vörut\" jumpt bi't Afspelen teihn Perzent vun dat Stück sien Längde vörut. Disse Befehl is verföögbor, wenn en Datei afspeelt warrt."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:543
msgid "&Backward"
msgstr "&Torüch"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:545
msgid "Moves playback backward"
msgstr "Jumpt bi't Afspelen torüch"

#: kplayerengine.cpp:546
msgid ""
"Backward command moves playback backward by one percent of the time length "
"of the current file. This command is available when playing a file."
msgstr "De Befehl \"Torüch\" jumpt bi't Afspelen en Perzent vun dat Stück sien Längde achterrut. Disse Befehl is verföögbor, wenn en Datei afspeelt warrt."

#: kplayerengine.cpp:551
